{"id":466,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"全人教育で個性を磨く甲南女子の学び","feature_description":"甲南女子中学校・高等学校は、建学の理念『まことの人間をつくる』のもと、全人教育・個性尊重・自学創造を柱に生徒を育てる学校です。教育理念と学校生活が結びついており、部活動や学校行事を通して主体性と協働性を養います。自分の資質を伸ばしながら、知性と品位を育てやすい環境です。日々の学びを自分の言葉で深めやすい校風です。中高のつながりも感じやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":9248,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9249,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9250,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9251,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9252,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9253,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9254,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9255,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9256,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9257,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/club/club-broadcasting.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9258,"name":"J.R.C部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9259,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9260,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.konan-gs.ed.jp/schoollife/club/","verified_